                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For older Texans in #TX32, the Republican health care plan is devastating. A 60-year-old couple could see premiums rise 252% \u2014 that\u2019s over $17,000 more a year.\n\nAfter a lifetime of work, no one should be priced out of care.\n\n#TX32 #SeniorCare https://t.co/nCWTJ1q0cW",
