                "text": "Even middle-class families aren\u2019t spared. A household making $129,800 could see premiums rise by 84% \u2014 nearly $9,200 a year.\n\nThat\u2019s money for child care, groceries, or savings \u2014 gone. Texans deserve stability, not skyrocketing costs.\n\n#TX32 #HealthCareCosts https://t.co/0iFUToD6ff",
